<https://ontologies.verizon.com/taxonomy-core-process/>
  a skos:ConceptScheme ;
  skos:prefLabel "Taxonomy | Core | Process"@en ;
  dct:description "The process taxonomy organizes and defines the elements of a process, such as process steps (individual actions or tasks), observations (data gathered during the process) and measurements (quantifiable values derived from observations) to provide a structured understanding of how a process works."@en ;
  dct:title "Taxonomy | Core | Process"@en ;
